OL,3,GNEWSAArcade machine dumped on mountain
OL,4,Aas fly-tipped fined
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fly-tipper has been made to pay
OL,7,F#1,200 after dumping an arcade machine
OL,8,Fand other household rubbish on a
OL,9,Fmountain in the Swansea Valley.
OL,11,FA fridge-freezer and a gaming chair
OL,12,Fwere also found among the waste near
OL,13,FGwrhyd Road in Rhiwfawr in April.
OL,15,FAn investigation by enforcement
OL,16,Fofficers from Neath Port Talbot Council
OL,17,Fled them to Wayne Thompson, 41, of
OL,18,FBrecon Road, Ystradgynlais.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
